27127      title 'Gasoline and Emissions Data';
27128      data gas;
27129      set sashelp.gas;
27130      if fuel in ('Ethanol', '82rongas', 'Gasohol');
27131      run;

NOTE: There were 171 observations read from the data set SASHELP.GAS.
NOTE: The data set WORK.GAS has 112 observations and 4 variables.

27132      ods graphics on;
27133      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
27134      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
27135      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27136      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1663.

27137      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
27138      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
27139      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
27140      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
27141      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
