27151      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27152      data a;
27153      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27154      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27167      ;
27168      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27169      proc transreg ss2;
27170      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27171      output coefficients replace;
27172      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA29 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
